bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    jit_dict_f64_key_get_membership_aarch64_2026-11-26, 0, "codegen::local_execution_tests was x86_64-gated; un-gated on aarch64 the float-literal Dict key test fails. Isolated, deterministic (3 runs): float_index=7, float_get returns a heap-tagged value (low bits 001), float_membership=0. In the workspace-wide build float_index also returned a heap-tagged value. Whether x86 passes is not established."

bugs_active |id, severity, status, title, file, line, reproducible_by, created_at, updated_at, valid|
    jit_dict_f64_key_get_membership_aarch64_2026-11-26, P2, fixed, "JIT Dict<f64,i64> float-key test: has_key typed ANY (raw bool re-decoded by rt_value_truthy) and stale get-returns-bare-V expectation; not aarch64-specific", src/compiler_rust/compiler/src/hir/lower/expr/mod.rs, 2968, cargo test -p simple-compiler --lib -- codegen::local_execution_tests::test_cranelift_jit_typed_dict_float_literal_key_compatibility, 2026-11-26, 2026-11-26, true

bug_investigation_logs |bug_id, line_num, content|
    jit_dict_f64_key_get_membership_aarch64_2026-11-26, 0, "2026-11-26 filed by work/bug-arm64-tooling-20261126; test left red (not re-gated). Related: cargo_test_lib_does_not_compile_on_aarch64_2026-09-13."
    jit_dict_f64_key_get_membership_aarch64_2026-11-26, 1, "2026-11-26 fixed on work/bug-jit-dict-f64-key-aarch64-20261126. NOT aarch64-specific: the test was x86_64-gated so it only ever ran on x86, and both causes are arch-neutral MIR/HIR. (1) has/contains returned false: HIR typed has_key as ANY (missing from the BOOL arm next to has/contains/contains_key), so as an and-operand the raw rt_contains byte went through rt_value_truthy as a tagged word and raw 1 read false; fix: has_key typed BOOL. (2) get returned a heap word: Dict.get returns V? since 9d21958ee39 (2026-11-03) and the 2026-09-29 test returned it bare from -> i64; test now unwraps with ?? 0. gdb confirmed raw f64 keys round-trip (rt_dict_set/rt_dict_get key 0x3ff0000000000000, value 0x38), so key boxing/hashing and JIT register classes were ruled out. Result: local_execution_tests 24/24. The admitted Option->scalar return is filed as optional_return_into_scalar_fn_accepted_2026-11-26."

